  "description": "Explore the unknown and blaze a path to faraway places full of undiscovered beauty. Epic adventures are waiting. No matter how far you decide to go, or how long it takes to arrive, the MMR is designed to get you there. Named for the “Minimum Maintenance Road” signs that off-grid riders become so familiar with, we gave the MMR 2.25” tire clearance, suspension-corrected geometry, and an internal storage bay, making it the most rugged, capable, and fun gravel adventure bike in the OBED line-up. 29” x 2.25” / 57mm tire clearance Suspension corrected geometry Rack and frame bag mounts Downtube storage bay Universal derailleur hanger T47 Outboard bottom bracket Integrated and non-integrated cable routing options",
